    <surveyls_title><![CDATA[Welcome to the User Study on Workflow Documentation]]></surveyls_title>
    <surveyls_description><![CDATA[<em>This survey contains 28 questions.</em>]]></surveyls_description>
    <surveyls_welcometext><![CDATA[<p> </p>

<p>Thank you for your interest in participating in this study.</p>

<p>The purpose of this study is to compare different approaches for automatically generating workflow documentations. During the study, you will review workflow documentation and answer a series of questions about your experience and understanding.</p>

<p>Click <b>Next </b>to begin.</p>
]]></surveyls_welcometext>
