<p style="text-align: center;">Your participation is greatly appreciated and contributes to my bachelor's thesis.</p>

<p style="text-align: center;">(⌒‿⌒)</p>

<p style="text-align: center;">Thank you for your time and support!</p>

<p style="text-align: center;"> </p>
]]></surveyls_endtext>
